---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Tormont 50 – Get in Touch" description="Interested in collaborating or learning more? Contact The Tormont 50 to explore services, request reports, or discuss investment opportunities." bodyClass="">
<div class="section top-section pd-bottom-140px"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="inner-container _740px center reveal-on-scroll"><div class="text-center mg-bottom-40px"><h1 class="display-1">Get in Touch with Our Team Today</h1></div></div><div class="flex gap-48px items-center"><div class="flex-horizontal align-end _w-50"><div><div class="shape _03 size-145px"><div class="circle-shape"></div></div><div class="shape _14 size-145px"></div></div><div class="photo-shape-wrapper _04"><img alt="" src="/images/68ca563afe01c79b90bcde6a_toronto.webp"/></div></div><div class="_w-50"><div class="accordion-item-wrapper v2 tabs-location"><div class="accordion-content-wrapper v2"><div class="accordion-header"><h3 class="accordion-title">Tormont 50</h3></div><div class="acordion-body"><div class="accordion-spacer"></div><div class="max-w-434px max-w-100-tablet"><p class="mg-bottom-24px">We’d love to hear from you! Whether you have questions, need support, or are interested in learning more about our services, our team is here to assist you. </p></div><div class="grid-1-column gap-row-32px"><div class="flex align-center"><img alt="Email - Corpkit X Webflow Template" class="circle-icon _48px-mbl mg-right-16px" src="/images/68c878e01b5edefb6e67af98_icon-email-corpkit-x-webflow-template.svg"/><div><div class="text-100 color-neutral-600 mg-bottom-8px">Email address</div><div class="text-100 bold color-neutral-800"><strong>info@tormontgroup.com</strong></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion-side right-side"><div class="accordion-icon-wrapper"><div class="accordion-btn-line vertical"></div><div class="accordion-btn-line horizontal"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="inner-section-bottom-rounded-corners bg-neutral-200 reveal-on-scroll"><div class="inner-container _1068px center"><div class="w-layout-grid text-and-form-single-grid"><div class="reveal-on-scroll"><h2 class="display-2">Get in touch today</h2><p class="mg-bottom-32px">Every great partnership starts with a conversation. Connect with us today and let’s explore how The Tormont 50 can support your vision.</p><div class="max-w-350px max-w-100-tablet"><a class="card-link-icon-left-container justify-space hover-none w-inline-block" href="mailto:info@tormontgroup.com"><div class="flex-horizontal justify-start vertical-mbp"><img alt="Help And Support - Corpkit X Webflow Template" class="circle-icon _48px-mbl mg-right-16px" src="/images/68c878e01b5edefb6e67b04a_help-and-support-circle-icon-corpkit-webflow-ecommerce-template.svg"/><div><div class="text-100 color-neutral-600 mg-bottom-8px">Help &amp; support</div><div class="text-100 bold color-neutral-800">i<strong>nfo@tormontgroup.com</strong></div></div></div><div class="line-rounded-icon link-icon-right icon-size-20px"></div></a></div></div><div class="mg-bottom-0 w-form reveal-on-scroll"><form data-name="Contact V3 Form" id="wf-form-Contact-V3-Form" method="get" name="wf-form-Contact-V3-Form"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-2-columns form"><div><label for="Name-4">Full name</label><input class="input w-input" data-name="Name" id="Name-4" maxlength="256" name="Name" placeholder="John Carter" required="" type="text"/></div><div><label for="Email-4">Email address</label><input class="input w-input" data-name="Email" id="Email-4" maxlength="256" name="Email" placeholder="example@youremail.com" required="" type="email"/></div><div><label for="Phone-4">Phone</label><input class="input w-input" data-name="Phone" id="Phone-4" maxlength="256" name="Phone" placeholder="(123) 456 - 7890" required="" type="tel"/></div><div><label for="Subject">Subject</label><input class="input w-input" data-name="Subject" id="Subject" maxlength="256" name="Subject" placeholder="ex. Subject" required="" type="text"/></div><div id="w-node-_110befa7-48fd-b74b-5b53-2683c7366b7e-6e67adad"><label for="Message-4">Message</label><textarea class="text-area w-input" data-name="Message" id="Message-4" maxlength="5000" name="Message" placeholder="Type your message here"></textarea></div><input class="btn-primary w-button" data-wait="Please wait..." id="w-node-_110befa7-48fd-b74b-5b53-2683c7366b82-6e67adad" type="submit" value="Send Message"/></div></form><div class="success-message-transparent w-form-done"><div class="contact-form-success-message"><div class="line-rounded-icon success-message-check large"></div><h3>Thank you</h3><div>Thanks for reaching out. We will get back to you soon.</div></div></div><div class="error-message w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section"><div class="container-default w-container"><div class="text-center mg-bottom-40px reveal-on-scroll"><h2 class="display-2">Frequently asked questions</h2><p>Have questions? We’ve got answers! </p></div><div class="inner-container _960px center reveal-on-scroll"><div class="grid-2-columns title-and-paragraph-grid"><div class="max-w-332px max-w-100-mbl" id="w-node-_1957a36a-f582-3c34-bee7-62f80c379f54-6e67adad"><h3 class="mg-bottom-0"><strong>What exactly does Tormont 50 do?</strong></h3></div><p class="mg-bottom-0">We take strategy out of the clouds and put it into action. Boards, CEOs, and shareholders usually know something isn’t working — alignment, messaging, governance, or market trust. Tormont Strategies is where you go when you need those issues solved, quickly and cleanly. Think of us as the “execution arm” of the Tormont 50 process: they diagnose, we deliver.</p></div><div class="divider _40px"></div><div class="grid-2-columns title-and-paragraph-grid"><div class="max-w-388px max-w-100-mbl" id="w-node-c5fc7eff-84e1-5ba5-9034-fc2423187404-6e67adad"><h3 class="mg-bottom-0"><strong>Who do you work with?</strong></h3></div><p class="mg-bottom-0"><strong>Boards</strong> that want independent accountability frameworks.<br/><strong>CEOs</strong> who need clarity on how their leadership and strategy are really perceived.<br/><strong>Shareholders</strong> who want to know their value is protected and growing.<br/><br/></p></div><div class="divider _40px"></div><div class="grid-2-columns title-and-paragraph-grid"><div class="max-w-388px max-w-100-mbl" id="w-node-_3f0bdeb2-572c-a3c1-95ee-1b390874dde3-6e67adad"><h3 class="mg-bottom-0"><strong>How do I start?</strong></h3></div><p class="mg-bottom-0">Easy. You don’t need a 40-page RFP.Book a Discovery Call/Offsite (the quickest way to see what’s off track).<br/><br/>We’ll run you through our Shareholder Value Audit.<br/><br/>From there, we map the fixes: rapid resolutions, design frameworks, and feedback loops.<br/><br/>You’ll walk away knowing exactly where the disconnects are and how to fix them.</p></div><div class="divider _40px"></div><div class="grid-2-columns title-and-paragraph-grid"><div class="max-w-332px max-w-100-mbl" id="w-node-_355dc979-f156-1fcd-fb27-1a8efdab5c6e-6e67adad"><h3 class="mg-bottom-0"><strong>What does it cost?</strong></h3></div><p class="mg-bottom-0">Here’s the honest answer: it depends on your problem. Some issues can be solved in weeks; others require deeper design and long-term execution.<br/><br/>A Discovery Offsite or Audit is a set engagement with a clear price.<br/>Resolutions, design, and execution scale depending on scope.<br/><br/>We’re transparent up front, and we don’t nickel-and-dime. But if you’re looking for the lowest bidder, that’s not us. We’re the team you hire when you need things done right the first time.</p></div></div></div></div>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('wf-form-Contact-V3-Form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  if (form) {
    const wrapper = form.closest('.w-form');
    const doneEl = wrapper?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.w-form-done');
    const failEl = wrapper?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.w-form-fail');

    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!form.checkValidity()) {
        form.reportValidity();
        if (failEl) failEl.style.display = 'block';
        return;
      }
      form.style.display = 'none';
      if (failEl) failEl.style.display = 'none';
      if (doneEl) doneEl.style.display = 'block';
    });
  }
</script>
</Layout>
